<!-- WHO WE ARE -->
<section id="about" class="section bg-image">
    {% image "/src/img/pioneer-hero-dsk.jpg", "", [400, 800, 1280], "100vw", "bg-image--img" %}
    <div class="section--container | stack-large">
        <div class="about">
            <div class="about--text | stack">
                <span class="section-label section-label--light">Why Choose Pioneer PGD</span>
                <h2 class="text-balance">Local, qualified, and built around doing the job properly</h2>
                <div class="section-content | stack">
                    <p>Pioneer PGD is owned and operated from Silverstream, Upper Hutt, with Certifying Plumber, Certifying Gasfitter and Certifying Drainlayer licences, the highest level of licensing issued by the Plumbers, Gasfitters and Drainlayers Board for all three trades.</p>
                    <p>That means one call can cover the lot, plumbing, gasfitting and drainage, without having to coordinate multiple trades.</p>
                    <p>Every job is different, so we take the time to understand your needs, your property and your situation, then tailor the solution accordingly.</p>
                    <p>With {{ reviews.google.count }} five-star Google reviews, competitive flat-rate initial service callout fees and the option of fixed-price quotes following a site visit, you can deal with a local, experienced and fully certified team you can trust.</p>
                    <p><strong>Local. Friendly. Reliable. Certified.<br>One call. Problem solved.</strong></p>
                </div>
                 <div class="cta-dual">
                    <a href="/contact/" class="button--primary">Contact us</a>
                    <a href="/about/" class="button--secondary">Learn more about us</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about--badge">
                {% image "/src/img/pioneer-certifying-icons.png", "Certified Plumbing, Gasfitting and Drainlaying badges", [200, 400], "400px", "about--badge-img" %}
                {% image "/src/img/pgd-zip-hut-valley.png", "Certified Plumbing, Gasfitting and Drainlaying badges", [200, 400], "400px", "about--badge-img" %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>